271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (I'm quite happy with my visit to Paris and especially the Bitcoin places that I found. I love the opportunity to find some random or hidden gems in the city that I would have never been able to visit if it weren't for Bitcoin. I love talking to the staff and the owners, there is always something to learn, and sometimes to teach, about how people are using Bitcoin. I also went to six other places, four of which were closed, and two of which no longer accept Bitcoin. At one of these places, the doors and cash register covered in Bitcoin stickers, I was practically laughed at for asking to pay with Bitcoin, before being asked to pay one Bitcoin to buy everyone a round. Finally one reason to implement BIP 177.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
