>>
endobj
311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 793 0 R
/E (Arbitration shifts leverage toward the bank. Proceedings are private, class claims are barred, fees can include your share of arbitrator costs, and judicial review of an arbitration award is very limited.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [38]
>>
endobj
